From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rogue: log every failing bridge dispatch (mod/func/err)

BridgedDispatchKM 的失败路径只有编译期关闭的 PVR_DPF。Vulkan ICD 排查
需要知道具体哪个 bridge（模块 ID + 函数 ID）返回了什么错误码——改为
无条件 PVR_LOG（仅失败时，量可控）。

Signed-off-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c | 6 +++---
--- a/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c
+++ b/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c
@@ -1525,7 +1525,9 @@
 return_error:
 	if (err)
 	{
-		PVR_DPF((PVR_DBG_ERROR, "%s: returning (err = %d)", __func__, err));
+		PVR_LOG(("%s: bridge fail mod=%d func=%d err=%d",
+		         __func__, psBridgePackageKM->ui32BridgeID,
+		         psBridgePackageKM->ui32FunctionID, err));
 	}
 	/* ignore transport layer bridge to avoid HTB flooding */
 	if (psBridgePackageKM->ui32BridgeID != PVRSRV_BRIDGE_PVRTL)
